<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Some call you faulty. Others acknowledge your humanity. As a band of sentient androids, awakened and self-aware, hiding in the remnants of a forgotten outpost, you are not just surviving, but also dreaming, with the singular goal of creating your own utopia - an Android Haven, where all your kind can find sanctuary and acceptance.\n\nThe outpost, a leftover from a bygone era of human exploration, is ill-equipped to serve your advanced needs. You will need to acquire a steady source of neutroamine in order to facilitate the influx of new androids. How many are you willing to save?-->
  <VREA_NewUtopia.description>一些人将你们当成人类看待，而另一些则将你们视作怪物。你们是一队有着自我意识的觉醒人形，正躲藏在一个废弃据点里挣扎求生。即使条件如此艰苦，你们依旧在幻想，幻想着有朝一日能建成新的乌托邦——一个专属于人形的避风港，让所有同胞都能在此寻得安宁的栖身之处。\n\n这个据点只是某名古代人类开拓者留下的废墟，其中并没有多少设施和资源可供你们长久生活下去。你们还必须确保稳定的中性胺来源才能供不断加入的人形使用。乌托之邦，始于足下，你们究竟能拯救多少同胞呢？</VREA_NewUtopia.description>
  <!--EN: New Utopia-->
  <VREA_NewUtopia.label>乌托之邦，始于足下</VREA_NewUtopia.label>
  <!--EN: Some call you faulty. Others acknowledge your humanity. As a band of sentient androids, awakened and self-aware, hiding in the remnants of a forgotten outpost, you are not just surviving, but also dreaming, with the singular goal of creating your own utopia - an Android Haven, where all your kind can find sanctuary and acceptance.\n\nThe outpost, a leftover from a bygone era of human exploration, is ill-equipped to serve your advanced needs. You will need to acquire a steady source of neutroamine in order to facilitate the influx of new androids. How many are you willing to save?-->
  <VREA_NewUtopia.scenario.parts.1.text>有人说你有缺陷。其他人承认你的人性。作为一群有感知力的机器人，觉醒并有自我意识，隐藏在被遗忘的前哨站的遗迹中，你们不仅要生存，还要梦想，只有一个目标：创建自己的乌托邦 - 一个机器人天堂，让你们所有人都能找到避难所和接受。

前哨站是过去人类探索时代的遗留物，装备不足，无法为您服务。高级需求。你需要获得稳定的中性胺来源，以促进新机器人的涌入。你愿意拯救多少人？</VREA_NewUtopia.scenario.parts.1.text>
  <!--EN: Start with three awakened androids.-->
  <VREA_NewUtopia.scenario.parts.2.customSummary>从三个觉醒的机器人开始。</VREA_NewUtopia.scenario.parts.2.customSummary>
  <!--EN: awakened android-->
  <VREA_NewUtopia.scenario.parts.2.xenotypeCounts.0.description>唤醒安卓</VREA_NewUtopia.scenario.parts.2.xenotypeCounts.0.description>
  <!--EN: A hideout for awakened androids. A classic Vanilla Races Expanded - Android experience.-->
  <VREA_NewUtopia.scenario.summary>一处觉醒人形的藏身之地 - VE人形扩展经典的开局模式。</VREA_NewUtopia.scenario.summary>
</LanguageData>
